@startuml
title SkillBridge Malawi - System Architecture and Output Design

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 210
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor "Student / Graduate" as Student
actor Employer
actor Administrator as Admin

rectangle "SkillBridge Malawi" {
  package "Web application\nReact + Vite" as Web {
    component "Public pages\nLanding, features,\nemployer information" as PublicUI
    component "Authentication UI\nSign in, registration,\npassword recovery" as AuthUI
    component "Student workspace" as StudentUI
    component "Employer workspace" as EmployerUI
    component "Admin workspace" as AdminUI
    component "Shared UI\nDashboards, navigation,\nnotifications, accessibility" as SharedUI
    component "Frontend service layer\nAuth, profiles, skills, jobs,\napplications, analytics, etc." as WebServices
    component "Dashboard analytics\nand report generation" as Analytics
    component "Supabase client\nBrowser publishable key" as SbClient
  }

  package "Application API\nNode.js" as API {
    component "HTTP API and\nBearer-token validation" as HttpAPI
    component "Career and skills API\nRecommendations, skill gaps,\nreadiness, roadmap, simulation" as CareerAPI
    component "Career assistant\nChat and conversation history" as ChatAPI
    component "CV analyzer\nDocument parsing and analysis" as CVAPI
    component "Placement search\nExternal listing aggregation" as PlacementAPI
    component "Deterministic scoring\nMatching and validation" as Scoring
    component "AI governance\nExplainability, validation,\nauditing and feedback" as Governance
  }

  package "Supabase platform" as Supabase {
    component "Supabase Auth\nIdentity and access tokens" as Auth
    database "PostgreSQL\nRow-level security, RPCs,\ntriggers and relational data" as DB
    folder "Supabase Storage\nProfile pictures, company logos,\nCVs, certificates and project media" as Storage
  }
}

cloud "Google Gemini\nOptional narrative enrichment" as Gemini
cloud "External job feeds\nArbeitnow, Remotive, Jobicy" as JobFeeds
component "CSV report downloads" as CSV

Student --> PublicUI
Student --> AuthUI
Student --> StudentUI
Employer --> PublicUI
Employer --> AuthUI
Employer --> EmployerUI
Admin --> AuthUI
Admin --> AdminUI

PublicUI --> SharedUI
AuthUI --> WebServices
StudentUI --> SharedUI
EmployerUI --> SharedUI
AdminUI --> SharedUI
SharedUI --> WebServices
StudentUI --> Analytics
EmployerUI --> Analytics
AdminUI --> Analytics
WebServices --> SbClient
Analytics --> SbClient
Analytics --> CSV : format and download

SbClient <--> Auth : sign in / token
SbClient <--> DB : direct authorized data access
SbClient <--> Storage : upload / retrieve assets
SbClient --> HttpAPI : HTTPS + access token

HttpAPI --> CareerAPI
HttpAPI --> ChatAPI
HttpAPI --> CVAPI
HttpAPI --> PlacementAPI
CareerAPI --> Scoring
CareerAPI --> Governance
ChatAPI --> Governance
CVAPI --> Governance

HttpAPI --> Auth : validate user token
CareerAPI <--> DB : read source data /\nstore results and feedback
ChatAPI <--> DB : conversation history
CVAPI <--> DB : document metadata /\nanalysis results
CVAPI <--> Storage : retrieve CV document
PlacementAPI --> JobFeeds : fetch and normalize listings
CareerAPI ..> Gemini : optional explanation
ChatAPI ..> Gemini : optional assistant response
CVAPI ..> Gemini : optional document insights
Governance --> DB : governance events,\naudits and feedback
note right of StudentUI
Student outputs:
- Career recommendations and roadmaps
- Skills gaps, competency evidence and readiness
- Assessments and learning pathways
- Matched jobs, internships and applications
- CV analysis, interview preparation and progress
- Notifications and career-assistant responses
end note

note right of EmployerUI
Employer outputs:
- Job and internship management
- Applicant reviews and recruitment stages
- Candidate assessments and interviews
- Offers, employment and organization analytics
end note

note right of AdminUI
Administrator outputs:
- User, employer and content management
- Labour-market intelligence
- Aggregate analytics and CSV reports
- AI monitoring, audit logs and data-quality views
end note

note bottom of DB
Core data domains:
profiles and role profiles; education; skills and evidence;
careers; assessments and learning; projects and portfolios;
jobs, applications and recruitment; employment; notifications;
AI recommendations, feedback and governance records.
end note

note bottom of HttpAPI
Server-only secrets (including Gemini and Supabase service-role
credentials) are not exposed to the browser. Authenticated API
requests are associated with the verified user.
end note

note bottom of Analytics
Dashboards query real platform records through the browser
Supabase client. Student and employer views are scoped by RLS;
admin reports use aggregate or authorized administrative data.
end note

legend bottom
  -->  Request or data flow
  <-->  Two-way interaction
  ..>  Optional external integration
endlegend

@enduml
